<title>POLAND: JUTRZENKA JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>JUTRZENKA JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.21 vs   0.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.82 vs   0.10 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.14 vs   0.35</p>
<p> Sales		   11.54 vs   7.61</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.86 vs   4.35</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.52 vs   6.55</p>
<p> Operating profit    10.33 vs   7.60</p>
<p> Sales		   70.29 vs  54.35</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectionary maker is Jutrzenka</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
